  "html": "<style>\n#ud-hero .ud-live--snapshot i{background:var(--muted);box-shadow:none;}\n/* UD-B2-W2: spine caveat disclosure — engine-verbatim lighter-evidence note.\n   Scope-narrowed to this hero template (the spine is a UD-B1 + UD-B2-W2\n   construct, never re-used elsewhere). Token-scoped only: every value is\n   a var() reference, no hex / rgba / colour-function / radius literal /\n   inline custom-property literal. This stays in the template (not\n   templates/theme.css) to keep the THEME-CLOSURE re-bind sweep out of\n   this PR's scope — the new rule only fires on the new .mx-spine-caveat\n   class, which is unique to the HK + CN bound rows. */\n.mx-spine-caveat{\n  margin-top:6px;\n  padding: 4px 8px;\n  border-left: 2px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius: var(--r-ctl,8px);\n  font-size: var(--fs-micro);\n  line-height: 1.45;\n  color: var(--ink-2);\n}\nhtml[data-theme=\"light\"] .mx-spine-caveat{ color: var(--ink-3); }\n\n/* UD-B2-W3 Drivers fold (R1 leadership tile, #33+#34 sentiment counterpart,\n   R6 breadth chip). Token-scoped only: every value is a var() reference.\n   Dark: luminance step on --panel2 rails. Light: hairline ring on the same\n   rails so the two treatments are not a token recolour. Scope-narrowed to\n   this hero so THEME-CLOSURE does not pull templates/theme.css into the PR. */\n.ud-driver-chip{ align-self:flex-start; margin-top:auto; }\n.ud-driver-leg{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:var(--sp-2,8px); }\n/* Spec §7: 390 hides the locked fourth card so the swipe is 1 / 3.\n   theme.css already declares this under body.page-macro; repeat it here\n   so the isolated evidence fixture (hero partial + theme.css) cannot\n   lose the hide if the live class ever drifts. */\n@media (max-width:390px){\n  .ud-driver--locked{ display:none; }\n}\n.ud-sent-lenses{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:var(--sp-2,8px); }\n.ud-sent-lens{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }\n.ud-sent-lens-name{\n  font-size:var(--fs-micro);\n  font-weight:700;\n  color:var(--ink-3);\n}\n.ud-sent-rail{\n  position:relative;\n  height:6px;\n  background:var(--panel2);\n  border-radius:var(--r-ctl);\n}\n.ud-sent-pin{\n  position:absolute;\n  top:-2px;\n  width:2px;\n  height:10px;\n  background:var(--ink-1);\n}\nhtml[data-theme=\"light\"] .ud-sent-rail{\n  background:var(--panel);\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line);\n}\n.ud-froth-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }\n.ud-froth-lbl{\n  font-size:var(--fs-micro);\n  color:var(--ink-3);\n  flex:0 0 auto;\n}\n.ud-froth-track{\n  flex:1;\n  height:4px;\n  background:var(--panel2);\n  border-radius:var(--r-ctl);\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n.ud-froth-fill{ height:100%; background:var(--warn); }\n.ud-froth-fill--b{ background:var(--act); }\nhtml[data-theme=\"light\"] .ud-froth-track{\n  background:var(--panel);\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line);\n}\n</style>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"ud-hero-h\" class=\"ud-hero panel span12 ud-hero-panel\" data-regime-scope=\"us-reference\" id=\"ud-hero\">\n<div class=\"ud-hero-inner\">\n<header class=\"ud-hero-head\">\n<span class=\"ud-eyebrow\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Global markets · Regime read</span><span class=\"l-zh\">全球市场 · 状态判读</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"ud-live ud-live--snapshot\">\n<i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"l-en\">Snapshot</span><span class=\"l-zh\">快照</span>\n</span>\n<span aria-label=\"as-of\" class=\"ud-asof tnum\"><span class=\"l-en\">2026-09-18</span><span class=\"l-zh\">2026-09-18</span></span>\n</header>\n<div class=\"ud-hero-grid\">\n<div class=\"ud-hero-copy\"><p class=\"ud-clause ud-scope-note\"><span class=\"l-en\">Headline and dial: US regime (SPY / QQQ / IWM), not a global composite. Each market row retains its own evidence and date.</span><span class=\"l-zh\">标题与仪表反映美国市场状态（SPY / QQQ / IWM），并非全球综合评分。各市场行保留独立证据与日期。</span></p>\n<h1 class=\"ud-verdict\" id=\"ud-hero-h\">\n<span class=\"l-en\"><span class=\"l-en ud-verdict-word ud-verdict-word--up\">Risk-on</span><span class=\"ud-verdict-comma l-en\">,</span> <span class=\"ud-verdict-qualifier ud-verdict-qualifier--warn l-en\">narrowing</span></span>\n<span class=\"l-zh\"><span class=\"l-zh ud-verdict-word ud-verdict-word--up\">风险偏好</span><span class=\"ud-verdict-qualifier ud-verdict-qualifier--warn l-zh\">在收窄</span></span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"ud-clause l-en\">Risk-on — the tape, breadth and cross-asset signals line up. Trend-following and adding on strength is supported.</p>\n<p class=\"ud-clause l-zh\">风险偏好 — 价格、广度与跨资产信号一致。顺势交易与逢强加仓得到支持。</p>\n<p class=\"ud-flip l-en\">→ Mixed if risk appetite breaks down.</p>\n<p class=\"ud-flip l-zh\">→ 若风险偏好走坏，则转「混合」。</p>\n<div class=\"ud-meta\">\n<span class=\"mx-stance mx-stance--warn\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Watch — don’t chase</span><span class=\"l-zh\">观察，勿追</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"ud-fired-chip\" data-tip-en=\"One fired condition today.\" data-tip-zh=\"今日有一条触发。\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">One fired condition today.</span><span class=\"l-zh\">今日有一条触发。</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-callout mx-callout\">\n<b class=\"l-en\">Read the dial with care:</b><b class=\"l-zh\">读数注意：</b>\n<span class=\"l-en\"> the dial is the measured blend; one input may rebuild tomorrow — check the as-of stamp.</span>\n<span class=\"l-zh\">仪表读数为测量综合——某项输入次日可能重建，请核对时间戳。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"regime score\" class=\"ud-hero-gauge\">\n<div class=\"ud-score\">\n<span class=\"ud-score-num tnum\" data-role=\"score\">61</span><span class=\"ud-score-out tnum\">/100</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-score-label\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">US regime score</span><span class=\"l-zh\">美国状态评分</span>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ud-prog-wrap\">\n<div class=\"ud-prog\">\n<span class=\"ud-prog-tick\" style=\"left:42%\"></span>\n<span class=\"ud-prog-tick\" style=\"left:60%\"></span>\n<span class=\"ud-prog-tick\" style=\"left:25%\"></span>\n<span class=\"ud-prog-tick\" style=\"left:75%\"></span>\n<i class=\"ud-prog-pin\" style=\"left:61.0%\"></i>\n<span class=\"ud-prog-fill\" style=\"width:61%\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-prog-anchors\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Risk-off</span><span class=\"l-zh\">避险</span>\n<span class=\"ud-prog-mid\"><span class=\"l-en\">Mixed</span><span class=\"l-zh\">混合</span></span>\n<span class=\"l-en\">Risk-on</span><span class=\"l-zh\">趋险</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<svg aria-label=\"regime score arc, value 61 of 100\" class=\"ud-arc\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 220 130\">\n<path class=\"ud-arc-track\" d=\"M 20 110 A 90 90 0 0 1 200 110\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".55\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"6\"></path><path class=\"ud-arc-stroke\" d=\"M 20 110 A 90 90 0 0 1 200 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"172.47 999\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"6\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-spine-wrap\">\n<div class=\"mx-sec\">\n<h3 class=\"l-en\">Where this shows up</h3><h3 class=\"l-zh\">这一状态体现在哪里</h3>\n<small class=\"mx-asof l-en\">One scale, five markets — where each sits, and which way it moved.</small>\n<small class=\"mx-asof l-zh\">同一标尺，五个市场——各自位置，以及本月移动方向。</small>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine\" data-spec=\"ud-b1\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-spine-head\">\n<span><span class=\"l-en\">Market</span><span class=\"l-zh\">市场</span></span>\n<span><span class=\"l-en\">Where it sits today</span><span class=\"l-zh\">今日位置</span></span>\n<span><span class=\"l-en\">Moved</span><span class=\"l-zh\">本月移动</span></span>\n<span><span class=\"l-en\">What to do</span><span class=\"l-zh\">该怎么做</span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-row\" data-stance=\"protect\" data-state=\"real\" data-subject=\"1\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-name\"><span class=\"l-en\">US stocks</span><span class=\"l-zh\">美股</span></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-rail-wrap\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-rail\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-n25\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n50\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n75\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-prev\" style=\"left:77%\"></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-conn\" style=\"left:61%;width:16%\"></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-mark\" style=\"left:61%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-anchors\"><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-off</span><span class=\"l-zh\">避险</span><span class=\"mx-spine-a-mid\"><span class=\"l-en\">Neutral</span><span class=\"l-zh\">中性</span></span><span><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-on</span><span class=\"l-zh\">趋险</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-travel\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-spine-arrow\">←</span><span class=\"tnum\">−16</span></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-stance\"><span class=\"mx-stance mx-stance--warn\"><span class=\"l-en\">Watch — don’t chase</span><span class=\"l-zh\">观察，勿追</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-row\" data-blocked-feed=\"hk_market_state\" data-caveat-en=\"Display-only and lighter than the US read: HK has no leading Risk Radar, no VIX term structure (VHSI stands in), and the downturn gauges are uncalibrated. HK is heavily globally driven — US/EM beta and the HKD peg. Context, not a forecast.\" data-caveat-zh=\"仅供展示，较美股版更轻量：港股没有领先的风险雷达、没有 VIX 期限结构（以 VHSI 替代），下行指标未经校准。港股高度受全球驱动 — 美股／新兴市场贝塔与港元联汇。是背景，而非预测。\" data-market=\"hk\" data-stance=\"stand-aside\" data-state=\"real\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-name\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Hong Kong</span><span class=\"l-zh\">香港</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-rail-wrap\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-rail\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-n25\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n50\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n75\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-prev\" style=\"left:57.0%\"></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-conn\" style=\"left:37%;width:20.0%\"></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-mark\" style=\"left:37%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-anchors\"><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-off</span><span class=\"l-zh\">避险</span><span class=\"mx-spine-a-mid\"><span class=\"l-en\">Neutral</span><span class=\"l-zh\">中性</span></span><span><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-on</span><span class=\"l-zh\">趋险</span></span></