v\" style=\"left:42%\"></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-conn\" style=\"left:37%;width:5%\"></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-mark\" style=\"left:37%\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-anchors\"><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-off</span><span class=\"l-zh\">避险</span><span class=\"mx-spine-a-mid\"><span class=\"l-en\">Neutral</span><span class=\"l-zh\">中性</span></span><span><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-on</span><span class=\"l-zh\">趋险</span></span></div><div class=\"mx-spine-caveat\">\n<span aria-label=\"As of 2026-09-18. Display-only and lighter than the US read: China has no leading Risk Radar, no VIX term structure (QVIX + margin froth stand in), no HY credit spread, and the downturn gauges are uncalibrated. It reads what has already turned — context, not a forecast.\" class=\"l-en\">As of 2026-09-18. Display-only and lighter than the US read: China has no leading Risk Radar, no VIX term structure (QVIX + margin froth stand in), no HY credit spread, and the downturn gauges are uncalibrated. It reads what has already turned — context, not a forecast.</span><span aria-label=\"截至 2026-09-18。仅供展示，较美股版更轻量：A股没有领先的风险雷达、没有 VIX 期限结构（以 QVIX 与融资拥挤替代）、没有高收益信用利差，且下行指标未经校准。它读取的是已经转向的信号 — 是背景，而非预测。\" class=\"l-zh\">截至 2026-09-18。仅供展示，较美股版更轻量：A股没有领先的风险雷达、没有 VIX 期限结构（以 QVIX 与融资拥挤替代）、没有高收益信用利差，且下行指标未经校准。它读取的是已经转向的信号 — 是背景，而非预测。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-travel\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-spine-arrow\">←</span><span class=\"tnum\">−5</span></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-stance\"><span class=\"mx-stance mx-stance--muted\"><span class=\"l-en\">Stand aside</span><span class=\"l-zh\">暂时观望</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-row\" data-blocked-feed=\"gov_bonds_regime\" data-null=\"1\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-name\"><span class=\"l-en\">Government bonds</span><span class=\"l-zh\">国债</span><small>—</small></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-rail-wrap\"><div class=\"mx-spine-rail\"><div class=\"mx-spine-n25\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n50\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n75\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-spine-anchors\"><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-off</span><span class=\"l-zh\">避险</span><span class=\"mx-spine-a-mid\"><span class=\"l-en\">Neutral</span><span class=\"l-zh\">中性</span></span><span><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-on</span><span class=\"l-zh\">趋险</span></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-travel\"><span class=\"muted l-en\">—</span><span class=\"muted l-zh\">—</span></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-stance\"><span class=\"mx-stance mx-stance--muted\"><span class=\"l-en\">Read being updated</span><span class=\"l-zh\">判读更新中</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-row\" data-blocked-feed=\"commodities_regime\" data-null=\"1\">\n<div class=\"mx-spine-name\"><span class=\"l-en\">Commodities</span><span class=\"l-zh\">大宗商品</span><small>—</small></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-rail-wrap\"><div class=\"mx-spine-rail\"><div class=\"mx-spine-n25\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n50\"></div><div class=\"mx-spine-n75\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-spine-anchors\"><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-off</span><span class=\"l-zh\">避险</span><span class=\"mx-spine-a-mid\"><span class=\"l-en\">Neutral</span><span class=\"l-zh\">中性</span></span><span><span class=\"l-en\">Risk-on</span><span class=\"l-zh\">趋险</span></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-travel\"><span class=\"muted l-en\">—</span><span class=\"muted l-zh\">—</span></div>\n<div class=\"mx-spine-stance\"><span class=\"mx-stance mx-stance--muted\"><span class=\"l-en\">Read being updated</span><span class=\"l-zh\">判读更新中</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"ud-spine-foot\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Positions are this week’s read on a shared scale — not price performance.</span>\n<span class=\"l-zh\">位置是本周在同一标尺上的判读，并非价格涨跌幅。</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-changed\">\n<div class=\"mx-sec\">\n<h3 class=\"l-en\">What changed since last look</h3><h3 class=\"l-zh\">与上次相比的变化</h3>\n<small class=\"mx-asof l-en\">Each row is one fired condition from the alert log.</small>\n<small class=\"mx-asof l-zh\">每行对应触发日志中的一次触发。</small>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-chg-row\">\n<span class=\"mx-chg-name tnum\"><span class=\"l-en\">Recent</span><span class=\"l-zh\">最近</span></span>\n<span class=\"mx-chg-what\"><span class=\"l-en\">Event-risk window: GDP (BEA estimate) in 10 days — elevated two-sided volatility expected. Not a sell signal; size for the noise.</span><span class=\"l-zh\">事件风险窗口：GDP 数据（10 天后）—— 预计升高的两面性波动。非卖出信号；按噪声调整仓位。</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"mx-stance mx-stance--warn\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Watch</span><span class=\"l-zh\">观察</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"mx-chg-chev\">›</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-drivers\">\n<div class=\"mx-sec\">\n<h3 class=\"l-en\">Why — the three things moving this read</h3><h3 class=\"l-zh\">为什么 — 推动本次判读的三件事</h3>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ud-driver-count\"><span class=\"l-en\">1 of 3</span><span class=\"l-zh\">1 / 3</span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-driver-grid\">\n<div class=\"panel ud-driver\" data-driver=\"mtf\">\n<b class=\"ud-driver-head\"><span class=\"l-en\">Mixed</span><span class=\"l-zh\">分化</span></b>\n<p class=\"ud-driver-body l-en\">Read being updated — tape read re-draws nightly.</p>\n<p class=\"ud-driver-body l-zh\">判读更新中——盘面读数每晚重绘。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel ud-driver\" data-driver=\"risk_envelope\">\n<b class=\"ud-driver-head\"><span class=\"l-en\">Market state</span><span class=\"l-zh\">市场状态</span></b>\n<p class=\"ud-driver-body l-en\">Read being updated — three reads below, never a fused score.</p>\n<p class=\"ud-driver-body l-zh\">判读更新中——下方为三项读数，非融合评分。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel ud-driver\" data-driver=\"fear_greed\">\n<b class=\"ud-driver-head\"><span class=\"l-en\">Neutral</span><span class=\"l-zh\">中性</span></b>\n<p class=\"ud-driver-body l-en\">Read being updated — sentiment context, display only.</p>\n<p class=\"ud-driver-body l-zh\">判读更新中——情绪背景，仅展示。</p>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"locked depth\" class=\"panel ud-driver ud-driver--locked\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-tier-blurred--spec\">\n<div class=\"ud-driver\"><b class=\"ud-driver-head\">██████</b><p class=\"ud-driver-body\">████ ████ ████████ ████ ███████</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-driver-lock\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Full sector narrative is locked.</span>\n<span class=\"l-zh\">完整板块叙事已锁定。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-watching\">\n<div class=\"mx-sec\">\n<h3 class=\"l-en\">What we’re watching next</h3><h3 class=\"l-zh\">接下来我们在盯什么</h3>\n<small class=\"mx-asof l-en\">Three conditions, each phrased as if → what it would change.</small>\n<small class=\"mx-asof l-zh\">三项条件，每条格式为「若 X，则将如何变化」。</small>\n</div>\n<details class=\"ud-watch-details\" open=\"\">\n<summary class=\"ud-watch-summary\">\n<div class=\"ud-watch-summary-row\">\n<span class=\"ud-watch-summary-h\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">GDP (BEA estimate)</span><span class=\"l-zh\">GDP 数据</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-summary-ct tnum\">3 <span class=\"l-en\">conditions</span><span class=\"l-zh\">项</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ud-watch-summary-chev\">›</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-summary-preview l-en\">If it lands against the read, it would shift the regime call.</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-summary-preview l-zh\">若与读数相反，将改变格局判断。</span>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"ud-watch-list\">\n<li class=\"ud-watch-item\">\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-head l-en\">GDP (BEA estimate)</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-body l-en\">If it lands against the read, it would shift the regime call.</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-head l-zh\">GDP 数据</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-body l-zh\">若与读数相反，将改变格局判断。</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ud-watch-item\">\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-head l-en\">PCE / personal income (BEA)</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-body l-en\">If it lands against the read, it would shift the regime call.</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-head l-zh\">PCE 物价指数</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-body l-zh\">若与读数相反，将改变格局判断。</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ud-watch-item\">\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-head l-en\">Jobs report (nonfarm payrolls)</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-body l-en\">If it lands against the read, it would shift the regime call.</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-head l-zh\">非农就业报告</span>\n<span class=\"ud-watch-item-body l-zh\">若与读数相反，将改变格局判断。</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<p class=\"ud-spine-foot\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Windows, not certainties — re-drawn nightly.</span>\n<span class=\"l-zh\">是窗口，不是定论——每晚重新校准。</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-deeper\">\n<div class=\"mx-sec\">\n<h3 class=\"l-en\">Go deeper</h3><h3 class=\"l-zh\">深入了解</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ud-deeper-rail\">\n<a class=\"ud-depth\" href=\"macro_context.html\"><span class=\"l-en\">Macro weather</span><span class=\"l-zh\">宏观气候</span></a>\n<a class=\"ud-depth\" href=\"sector_central.html\"><span class=\"l-en\">Sector rotation</span><span class=\"l-zh\">板块轮动</span></a>\n<a class=\"ud-depth\" href=\"signal_lab.html\"><span class=\"l-en\">Signal Lab</span><span class=\"l-zh\">信号实验室</span></a>\n<a class=\"ud-depth\" href=\"macro_signals.html\"><span class=\"l-en\">Macro signals</span><span class=\"l-zh\">宏观信号</span></a>\n<a class=\"ud-depth\" href=\"news.html\"><span class=\"l-en\">News feed</span><span class=\"l-zh\">新闻流</span></a>\n<a class=\"ud-depth\" href=\"macro_monetary.html\"><span class=\"l-en\">Macro &amp; Monetary hub</span><span class=\"l-zh\">宏观与货币中心</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"ud-foot\">\n<span class=\"l-en\">Re-drawn nightly. Windows and stances are our read of the evidence, not advice.</span>\n<span class=\"l-zh\">每晚重新校准。窗口与立场是我们对证据的判读，不构成投资建议。</span>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</section>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var hero=document.getElementById('ud-hero');\n  if(hero&&window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia('(max-width:640px)').matches){\n    hero.querySelectorAll('.ud-watch-details[open]').forEach(function(d){d.removeAttribute('open');});\n  }\n})();\n</script>